{"seq":1,"slug":"water-rendering","title":"渲染：把模拟变成通透的水——折射、反射与焦散","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-water-fluid-simulation/practice/water-rendering","wordCount":1767,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"渲染-把模拟变成通透的水-折射-反射与焦散\">渲染：把模拟变成通透的水——折射、反射与焦散</h1><p>一个残酷的事实：玩家夸「这水真好看」时，夸的几乎全是渲染，不是模拟。前三章辛苦解出的高度场或粒子，本身只是一堆数字；把它变成有深浅、会反光、能透视、浪尖泛白的画面，是渲染的活。而且这活的性价比极高——<a href=\"../foundations/plausible-vs-accurate\">可信与精确之别</a>里说过，廉价模拟配讲究着色，观感常胜过昂贵模拟配平庸着色。这一篇讲清水渲染的几个核心构件：深度分层的水色、菲涅尔反射、屏幕空间折射、水底焦散、浪尖泡沫。范围只到「渲染如何与模拟耦合取数据」，纯 shader 的实现细节指向专门的 <a href=\"../../game-water-rendering/\">61_game-water-rendering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-水的外观由几层信号叠成\">核心概念：水的外观由几层信号叠成</h2><p>水没有固有颜色，它的外观是若干光学效应叠加的结果，每一层都对应一个可算的信号。拆开看，一片水的最终像素由这些贡献合成：<strong>反射</strong>（天空/环境映在水面）、<strong>折射</strong>（透过水面看到的水下扭曲）、二者按<strong>菲涅尔</strong>权重混合，再叠上<strong>深度相关的吸收色</strong>（越深越暗越蓝绿）、水下的<strong>焦散</strong>光斑、以及浪尖的<strong>泡沫</strong>。理解这套分层，才知道每个效果该从模拟的哪个量取数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[水面法线&lt;br/&gt;来自模拟高度场] --&gt; B[菲涅尔系数 F]&#10;  B --&gt; C[反射: 采样环境/SSR]&#10;  B --&gt; D[折射: 偏移采样水下场景]&#10;  E[水深 = 水底深度 - 水面深度] --&gt; F[吸收色 Beer-Lambert]&#10;  E --&gt; G[浅处透明 深处不透明]&#10;  C --&gt; H[按 F 混合 反射×F + 折射×1-F]&#10;  D --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[叠焦散光斑]&#10;  H --&gt; J[叠浪尖泡沫&lt;br/&gt;来自 Jacobian/交互]&#10;  I --&gt; K[最终水面像素]&#10;  J --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n  A[水面法线&lt;br/&gt;来自模拟高度场] --&gt; B[菲涅尔系数 F]\n  B --&gt; C[反射: 采样环境/SSR]\n  B --&gt; D[折射: 偏移采样水下场景]\n  E[水深 = 水底深度 - 水面深度] --&gt; F[吸收色 Beer-Lambert]\n  E --&gt; G[浅处透明 深处不透明]\n  C --&gt; H[按 F 混合 反射×F + 折射×1-F]\n  D --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[叠焦散光斑]\n  H --&gt; J[叠浪尖泡沫&lt;br/&gt;来自 Jacobian/交互]\n  I --&gt; K[最终水面像素]\n  J --&gt; K</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>数据来自模拟的什么</th>\n<th>常用实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>反射</td>\n<td>水面法线</td>\n<td>屏幕空间反射 SSR / 平面反射 / 反射探针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折射</td>\n<td>水面法线</td>\n<td>用法线偏移采样已渲染的场景颜色缓冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>菲涅尔混合</td>\n<td>法线与视线夹角</td>\n<td>Schlick 近似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度水色</td>\n<td>水面深度 vs 水底深度</td>\n<td>Beer–Lambert 吸收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>焦散</td>\n<td>水面法线（聚光）</td>\n<td>焦散贴图 / 光线聚焦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泡沫</td>\n<td>FFT 雅可比 / 交互扰动</td>\n<td>泡沫遮罩 + 噪声纹理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"菲涅尔-为什么远处水像镜子-脚下水见底\">菲涅尔：为什么远处水像镜子、脚下水见底</h2><p>同一片水，脚下能看清水底，望向远处却像镜子反着天——这不是水变了，是<strong>菲涅尔效应</strong>：视线越接近掠射（与水面夹角越小），反射越强、折射越弱。它是水「有灵性」的头号功臣，缺了它水会平板得像塑料。工程上几乎都用 Schlick 近似算反射比例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = F_0 + (1 - F_0)\\,(1 - \\cos\\theta)^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 是视线与水面法线夹角，水的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.02</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0\\approx 0.02</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02</span></span></span></span></span>（垂直看几乎全透）。最终水色按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 在反射与折射间线性混合。这里法线是关键输入——它直接来自前面章节的模拟：<a href=\"../surface/wave-sum\">正弦波</a>/<a href=\"../surface/gerstner-waves\">Gerstner</a> 的解析法线、<a href=\"../surface/fft-ocean\">FFT 海洋</a>的 IFFT 法线贴图、或 SPH 屏幕空间重建的法线。法线的高频细节往往还叠一两张滚动的法线贴图补充，因为顶点分辨率不够细。菲涅尔与光照的完整模型见跨库的 <a href=\"../../shader-programming/shading-techniques/lighting-models\">14_shader-programming 光照模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"深度水色与折射-透明度是算出来的\">深度水色与折射：透明度是算出来的</h2><p>新手常把水做成一个固定半透明蓝色，结果浅滩和深海一个色，假得刺眼。真实的水<strong>颜色随穿过的水体厚度变化</strong>——光在水里按 Beer–Lambert 定律被指数吸收，红光衰减最快，所以浅处偏清、深处偏蓝绿、再深发暗：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>σ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>σ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = C_{water}\\big(1 - e^{-\\sigma\\,d}\\big) + C_{bottom}\\,e^{-\\sigma\\,d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2491em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0491em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是光穿过的水深，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是吸收系数。关键是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 怎么来——从<strong>深度缓冲</strong>算：水底的场景深度减去水面片元的深度，就是这个像素处的水厚度。这也顺带解决了岸边过渡：水深趋零处 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，水自然变透明、与沙滩无缝衔接，避免生硬的相交硬边。</p>\n<p>折射同理依赖法线：不是直接透视，而是用水面法线<strong>扰动采样坐标</strong>，去采样已经渲染好的水下场景颜色（grab pass / 场景颜色缓冲），造出「隔水看东西会晃」的扭曲。折射与反射的具体采样技巧、SSR 的实现细节，是跨库 <a href=\"../../game-water-rendering/shading/reflection-refraction\">61_game-water-rendering 反射与折射</a>的主场，这里只强调它们都吃同一个法线输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"焦散与泡沫-水的两处点睛\">焦散与泡沫：水的两处点睛</h2><p><strong>焦散</strong>是阳光穿过起伏水面被聚焦成的游动亮纹，投在水底或水中物体上——它是「阳光下的浅水」最勾人的细节。物理上它源自水面法线把平行光会聚/发散，精确算很贵（要追光线），游戏里绝大多数用预生成或程序化的<strong>焦散贴图</strong>投影到水下表面，再用水面运动驱动其流动，廉价而有效。少数高端实现用屏幕空间或光子聚焦做实时焦散。焦散的水下投射细节见跨库的 <a href=\"../../game-water-rendering/shading/underwater-caustics\">61_game-water-rendering 水下焦散</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>泡沫</strong>给水加「力气」——浪尖的白沫、拍岸的泡、船尾的航迹泡。它的数据来源直接接回模拟：FFT 海洋用<a href=\"../surface/fft-ocean\">雅可比行列式</a> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 标记波峰堆叠处生成泡沫；浅水与交互水则在扰动强烈处（<a href=\"buoyancy-interaction\">浮力与交互</a>注入的尾迹）累积泡沫。渲染上用一张泡沫遮罩混合泡沫纹理，配噪声打散、随时间衰减消散。焦散和泡沫都是典型的「小成本大回报」，是把水从「能看」推到「好看」的最后一公里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能与耦合-渲染不是免费午餐\">性能与耦合：渲染不是免费午餐</h2><p>水渲染的成本主要在几处：屏幕空间反射的额外光线步进、折射需要的场景颜色/深度拷贝、多张法线贴图采样、以及透明混合带来的 overdraw。远处的海还要叠 <a href=\"../surface/fft-ocean\">FFT 级联</a>的多张贴图采样。这些都是 GPU 侧开销，和模拟的 GPU 开销抢同一块预算，取舍手段（近处精细、远处降级到纯 shader 假水、LOD 切换）属于<a href=\"fluid-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>，其性能剖析方法见跨库的 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/gpu-bottlenecks\">24_game-performance-optimization GPU 瓶颈</a>。核心心法始终是：渲染与模拟共用法线、深度、扰动这几个信号，把有限预算优先砸在菲涅尔、深度水色这些「一眼定生死」的效果上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>水的外观是分层信号叠加：反射与折射按菲涅尔混合，叠深度相关吸收色、焦散、泡沫；每层都从模拟取特定数据。</li>\n<li>菲涅尔（Schlick 近似）让水「远处如镜、脚下见底」，是水有灵性的头号功臣，核心输入是水面法线。</li>\n<li>深度水色用深度缓冲算水厚度、按 Beer–Lambert 吸收，顺带做出岸边透明过渡；折射用法线扰动采样水下场景。</li>\n<li>焦散与泡沫是小成本大回报的点睛：焦散多用程序化贴图投影，泡沫数据接回 FFT 雅可比或交互扰动。</li>\n<li>渲染与模拟抢同一块 GPU 预算，共用法线/深度/扰动信号，预算优先给一眼定生死的效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>法线数据的上游：<a href=\"../surface/fft-ocean\">FFT 海洋</a></li>\n<li>泡沫扰动的上游：<a href=\"buoyancy-interaction\">浮力与交互</a></li>\n<li>渲染成本的取舍：<a href=\"fluid-in-practice\">落地与边界</a></li>\n<li>反射折射 shader 实现（跨库）：<a href=\"../../game-water-rendering/shading/reflection-refraction\">61_game-water-rendering 反射与折射</a></li>\n<li>焦散水下投射（跨库）：<a href=\"../../game-water-rendering/shading/underwater-caustics\">61_game-water-rendering 水下焦散</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"渲染：把模拟变成通透的水——折射、反射与焦散","id":"渲染-把模拟变成通透的水-折射-反射与焦散"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：水的外观由几层信号叠成","id":"核心概念-水的外观由几层信号叠成"},{"level":2,"text":"菲涅尔：为什么远处水像镜子、脚下水见底","id":"菲涅尔-为什么远处水像镜子-脚下水见底"},{"level":2,"text":"深度水色与折射：透明度是算出来的","id":"深度水色与折射-透明度是算出来的"},{"level":2,"text":"焦散与泡沫：水的两处点睛","id":"焦散与泡沫-水的两处点睛"},{"level":2,"text":"性能与耦合：渲染不是免费午餐","id":"性能与耦合-渲染不是免费午餐"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"浅水方程：介于高度场与体积之间的务实中间地带","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-water-fluid-simulation/volume/shallow-water"},"next":{"title":"浮力与交互：让水和世界互相施力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-water-fluid-simulation/practice/buoyancy-interaction"}}